],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"That's really sly of you, Hotaru...@Threatening me like that..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"If I were really sly I'd have gone and asked@Nikaido first..."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"…………"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"...The truth is, you know after I took you home@yesterday?"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story07","chara":[{"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"That's why I have to give up on love too...","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"You're fine with that?"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":".....[wait:0.8][chara:305701:lipSynch_1]Yeah..."},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"I'm not a child anymore..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Hmm..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"To give up so easily like that,@Nikaido is Nikaido too."},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Eh—?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"You know, Akarii...@Giving up on your own love..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"...means you'll be supporting Nikaido and Yuuna..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"...officially becoming engaged, right?"},{"chara":[{"id":304801,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"For his family and his company."},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"...That's right."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"That means helping Nikaido and Yuuna@get married."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"...?!"},{"chara":[{"id":304801,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"And you'll be the closest friend to them..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"...that will watch them get closer and closer."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Is that okay?"},{"chara":[{"id":304801,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Will you do that?"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Big Bro Haruto and Yuuna..."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":".....@.....[wait:0.8][chara:305701:lipSynch_1]I hate it..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":305701,"tear":1}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"I can't just do that...!"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305701,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Because... I still like him..."},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"I love Big Bro Haruto..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Then what do you want to do?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"I want to tell Big Bro Haruto how I feel..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"How you feel...?@You're going to tell him you like him?"},{"chara":[{"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"No, not that..."},{"chara":[{"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"That I don't want him to give up on love."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"f